---
description: Load the Go skills orchestrator before any Go task
alwaysApply: true
---

Before any Go coding, review, debugging, troubleshooting, or setup task, load the `golang-how-to` skill first — it routes to whichever other Go skills the task needs.

For this repo, also load `go-api-design` when touching HTTP handlers and `golang-security` when serving files or accepting paths.

Always apply:

- `golang-error-handling`
- `golang-security`
- `golang-testing`
